Spec: Mutation outcome metadata

Purpose:
  Retain the caller operation UUID and possible-submission state through asynchronous failure or cancellation.

Owns:
  ./OperationFuture.java
  ./MutationOutcomeUnknownException.java

Must:
  Keep the operation UUID immutable and possible-submission state monotonic.
  Arbitrate cancellation and the transport-entry claim atomically so pre-entry cancellation cannot later submit.
  Preserve normal CompletableFuture cancellation; cancellation after transport entry is not proof of rollback.
  Use fixed unknown-outcome messages without raw causes or response data.
